; Roadshow's configuration API (rscfg): routes, default gateway, name
; servers, default domain, interface settings. rscfg puts everything back.
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START >DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
DH0:PrismNet/net/ping 10.0.2.2 COUNT=2 QUIET >NIL:
DH0:PrismNet/rscfg >>DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
Echo "--- route" >>DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
C:PrismNet ROUTE >>DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
Echo "--- arp" >>DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
C:PrismNet ARP >>DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
C:PrismNet STATUS >>DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
C:PrismNet LOG >>DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
C:PrismNet STOP >>DH0:PrismNet/rscfg.log
